Yolov8, a versatile model, excels in computer vision tasks, especially object
detection. It enhances the yolov5 model with a new network structure while
preserving the strengths of previous YOLO series algorithms. Building on
the anchor-free mechanism and integrating a Decoupled Head design
inspired by YOLOX, Yolov8 achieves a 1% boost in detection accuracy.
This innovative approach allows specialized branches for specific prediction
tasks, enhancing overall performance. Yolov8&#39;s loss function, featuring
components like Distribution Focal Loss and CIoU loss, ensures accurate
object detection and localization
